{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"Brokerage commissions, bid–ask spreads and market impact are **portfolio transaction costs**. They reduce the fund’s assets and therefore its NAV as trades are executed (spreads and market impact are embedded in execution prices, not necessarily booked as separate fee lines).\n\nThey are **not included in the ETF’s reported expense ratio**, which generally reflects operating expenses such as management, administration and custody fees, net of waivers. Transaction costs may be disclosed separately in the prospectus or shareholder reports and can affect performance and tracking difference. Investors also bear their own trading costs—such as the bid–ask spread when buying or selling ETF shares—which do not enter the fund’s NAV or expense ratio."}}
